{"path":"/services/conversion-measurement/","slug":"services__conversion-measurement","kind":"service","title":"Marketing Measurement & Reporting for B2B | Legency Media","description":"Analytics and attribution built so the numbers hold up in a board meeting, paid media run against them, and one monthly report a marketing leader can forward to the CEO unedited.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Measurement &amp; Reporting</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The numbers you take into the board meeting hold up when someone asks where they came from. We set up tracking a hard question cannot break, run the paid spend against it, and close every month with one document you can forward to your CEO without rewriting it.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Choosing a reporting system</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>What should a B2B website report include?</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>A useful B2B website reporting system connects search visibility, visitor behaviour and qualified enquiries to a dated record of work. Look for clear conversion definitions, comparable periods, source links, sample sizes and an owner for the next action. Keep paid, organic and AI referral traffic identifiable.</p><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Ask to trace one reported enquiry back to its source. Check how the system handles consent, duplicate events and CRM stages, and whether it distinguishes a form submission from a qualified opportunity. A report should state when the sample is too small to support a conclusion.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/how-we-work/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>See how our monthly process works<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Read a measured client example<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Numbers That Hold</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why Marketing Struggles to Prove Its Number</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Three people wired the events over four years</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Events were wired by three different people over four years. Two count the same thing, one fires twice, and the total has quietly been wrong for long enough that nobody wants to raise it.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The dashboard never answers whether it worked</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The dashboard updates in real time and the same question goes unanswered every month: did what we did last month work. Real-time data is not the same as a decision.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>You spend a morning translating the agency report</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The agency report arrives full of platform screenshots and vocabulary nobody upstairs uses, so the marketing lead spends a morning rewriting it before it can go anywhere.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A conversion means one thing everywhere</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Events audited and rebuilt so a conversion means one thing across analytics, ads and the CRM. Where a platform overcounts, we say by how much rather than quoting it and hoping.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Budget decisions are made with the page in view</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>We manage the campaigns and build the pages the clicks land on, so budget decisions are made with the landing page in front of us rather than the click cost alone.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One document a month you forward as it is</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One document a month: what changed, what it did, what happens next, with the number behind every claim. Plain language, no platform jargon, and nothing that needs translating before it goes upward.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The Monthly Engine</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Numbers You Can Defend Upward</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Lead Followed From First Visit to Closed Deal</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Analytics, conversion events, consent and CRM handoff, built so a lead can be followed from first visit to closed opportunity. This is the layer everything else depends on being right.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Paid Spend That Defends Itself</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Campaigns run by the team that builds the landing pages, so the spend and the page it lands on answer to the same number. Budget moves toward what converts, search terms get pruned continuously, and creative is tested rather than refreshed on a feeling.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The AI Channel Counted on Its Own</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Sessions arriving from AI assistants segmented and reported separately. It is a new channel in most analytics installs, and it is invisible unless somebody deliberately splits it out.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Report That Travels Upward Unedited</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>One document covering rankings, citations, conversions and spend, with the method behind each figure. Written to go to a CEO or a board without a rewrite, which is the only test that matters.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Before Any Number Is Trusted</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Most Analytics Installs Are Wrong in a Specific Direction</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>They are wrong in ways that flatter whatever is being measured, which is why nobody catches them. These four account for most of what we find on arrival, and every one of them ends up in a board deck if nobody looks.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>One action counted several times</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>A form that fires its event on submit and again on the thank-you page reports twice the conversions. We have measured a single demo request firing two and three times on a live client install. Every downstream number inherits that error, including the ones in board decks.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Events counted as people</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Event count and user count are different questions and most reports quote whichever is larger. If a form fires more than once per person, the honest figure is users, and the two have to be pulled side by side before either is quoted.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Consent silently removing traffic</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Under a consent banner, a proportion of visitors are never measured at all. That is correct behaviour and it still means the totals are not the whole picture. It has to be stated rather than quietly absorbed.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>AI traffic hidden inside direct</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Sessions arriving from an AI assistant often carry no search term and get bucketed into direct or referral by default. A growing channel becomes invisible unless somebody deliberately splits it out, which is exactly when you most want to see it.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>The Report</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Written for the Meeting After Yours</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>The test of a marketing report is whether it can be forwarded without being rewritten. Most fail it, which is why marketing leads spend a morning translating before anything goes upward. Ours are built to pass it.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Numbers before adjectives</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>What changed, by how much, over what window, against what baseline. The narrative comes after the figure and explains it, rather than standing in for it.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>A method beside every claim</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>Source, date range and denominator on each number, so a question about where a figure came from has an answer in the document instead of in somebody's inbox two days later.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e><h3 data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>The bad month said plainly</h3><p data-astro-cid-tnod2g5e>A report that only ever contains good news stops being read as information. When something fell, it is in there, with what we think caused it and what changes next.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>One report format, forwarded upward at Blueflame for eighteen months.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>The same monthly document has gone to Blueflame since the engagement began. It covers organic, paid, AI citations and site performance in one place, and it has never needed a rewrite before it went upward.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Numbers You Have</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What Your Analytics Is Actually Counting</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Before anything is optimised, the counting has to be right. A call about how your tracking is set up now, and what it would take to get to numbers that survive a hard question.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we audit events for duplicates and separate people from event counts</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How AI-assistant traffic gets split out of direct, where most installs bury it</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>One monthly report format you can forward without a rewrite</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/services/conversion-rate-optimization/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The testing side of this</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What is in the monthly report?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What shipped, what it changed and what runs next, with the numbers behind each point: organic performance, AI citations, conversions and paid spend. Every figure names its source and its date range, so a question about where a number came from has an answer before it is asked.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Why does tracking need auditing before anything else?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Because most of it is wrong in a specific direction. Duplicate events, a form that fires twice, a thank-you page counted alongside the submit, consent blocking a tag on half the traffic. Optimising against numbers like that moves budget toward whatever is being overcounted, and the error ends up in a board deck.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you manage paid campaigns as well?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes, Google Ads alongside the site. That closes the usual gap where one agency owns the spend and another owns the page the click lands on, and neither is accountable for the result.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you report on AI-referred traffic?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes, and it is worth separating. Sessions from ChatGPT, Perplexity and similar arrive with no search term and get grouped with direct or referral traffic by default. We split the channel out and report it beside citation counts, so the visibility work and the traffic it produces sit on the same page.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Is conversion rate optimization part of this?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It is a separate service, on its own page. Measurement makes the testing possible, and the testing programme is where the changes get made. Most clients run both, and they are scoped separately so it is clear what each one is doing.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What tools do you use?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>GA4 and Search Console as the base, a search data provider for rankings and competitor data, our own citation panel for AI answers, and whatever CRM you already run. We do not resell a proprietary dashboard, because the numbers should stay checkable after we leave.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".page-brief[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{background:var(--white,#fff);border-block:1px solid #0c0c141f;padding-block:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.page-brief__inner[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,5rem);display:grid}h2[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:20ch;margin-top:.75rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15}p[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:65ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.125rem);line-height:1.65}ul[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.5rem;margin:1.25rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex}a[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{color:var(--blue);